    {
      "id": "claim-ugarit-schaeffer-founding-excavation",
      "kind": "fact",
      "statement": {
        "zh": "Schaeffer 领导的拉斯沙姆拉使命自 1929 年起建立乌加里特田野考古传统（CRAI 通报；Yon 综述）。",
        "en": "Schaeffer’s Mission de Ras Shamra from 1929 established the founding field tradition for Ugarit (CRAI notices; Yon synthesis)."
      },
