    {
      "id": "claim-ugarit-destruction-horizon",
      "kind": "fact",
      "statement": {
        "zh": "发掘记录晚青铜末毁弃层；其绝对年代与外因解释仍有争议（Yon 2006）。",
        "en": "Excavation records a terminal LBA destruction horizon; absolute dating and external-cause explanations remain debated (Yon 2006)."
      },
