    {
      "id": "claim-ugarit-sea-peoples-hypothesis",
      "kind": "hypothesis",
      "statement": {
        "zh": "假说：将乌加里特毁弃直接归因于「海上民族」的单一因果模型证据不足，宜作假说而非事实（Yon/Singer 讨论语境）。",
        "en": "Hypothesis: single-cause ‘Sea Peoples’ models for Ugarit’s destruction are underdetermined and should remain hypotheses, not facts (Yon/Singer discussion context)."
      },
      "site_ids": [
        "site-ras-shamra-ugarit"
      ],
